GeoNames gazetteer extract
==========================

Files: places.tsv.gz, countries.tsv, VERSION (and ../legacy_gen.go)

Source: GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/), export dump of 2026-11-04:
cities5000.zip, admin1CodesASCII.txt, countryInfo.txt and
alternateNamesV2.zip from https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/.

License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Attribution shown to users:
"Place data © GeoNames (geonames.org), CC BY 4.0" (geo.Attribution, returned by
GET /api/v1/astrology/places).

Changes: reduced to identifier, name, ASCII name, country, first-level region
name, coordinates (4 decimals), population, IANA time zone and up to six
English/French/Spanish alternate names for places of 15,000+ inhabitants.

Regenerate (from backend/internal/astro/geo):

    curl -O https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/cities5000.zip
    curl -O https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/admin1CodesASCII.txt
    curl -O https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/countryInfo.txt
    curl -O https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/alternateNamesV2.zip
    go run ./gen -src . -altnames alternateNamesV2.zip -out data \
        -legacy-out legacy_gen.go -version YYYY-MM-DD
